<h2>Questions from Evanston property owners</h2><div class="faq"><details><summary>Are ice dam leaks covered?</summary><div class="faq-a"><p>Many policies cover sudden water damage from ice dams, though wording varies. The extent of interior and roof repair is a valuation question once coverage is accepted.</p></div></details><details><summary>My carport collapsed under snow. Is it covered?</summary><div class="faq-a"><p>It depends on your policy’s collapse provisions, which sometimes treat structures like carports differently. That coverage question comes first.</p></div></details></div>
